    #-- the projectile step's threshold, which has to sit between two numbers -
    # THIS IS THE FACT THAT KEEPS THE STEP ABLE TO FAIL. `minTravel` is the
    # whole difference between "a projectile flew" and "a projectile exists",
    # and it is wrong in BOTH directions:
    #
    #   too LOW  -- under `stationary`, and the step passes on a build that
